    "name": "Eventzilla Attendees Events API",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json",
    "description": {
      "content": "The Eventzilla REST API provides access to event management operations including listing and retrieving events, managing ticket categories, processing registrations and orders, managing attendees, performing check-ins, and handling checkout workflows. Authentication is via an API key passed in the x-api-key request header.\n\nContact Support:\n Name: Eventzilla Support\n Email: support@eventzilla.net",
